{"id":"level-up-2026-09-20","name":"2026-09-20 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s201","en":"He felt a slight ache in his calf muscle after running.","zh":"跑步后，他感到小腿肌肉有些酸痛。","note":"muscle · 肌肉； 体力； 力量， 实力 · a calf muscle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s202","en":"A generous donation allowed the shelter to replace its broken windows.","zh":"一笔慷慨的捐款让收容所得以更换破损的窗户。","note":"generous · 慷慨的； 大量的 · a generous donation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s203","en":"Constant interruptions can be detrimental to work that requires concentration.","zh":"持续的打扰会损害需要专注的工作。","note":"detrimental · 不利的， 有害的 · detrimental to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s204","en":"The bus was travelling in the opposite direction from our hotel.","zh":"公交车朝着与我们酒店相反的方向行驶。","note":"direction · 方向；趋势，动向； · in the opposite direction","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s205","en":"The gallery's new exhibition features photographs of abandoned railway stations.","zh":"画廊的新展览展出了一系列废弃火车站的照片。","note":"exhibition · 展览； 陈列 · a photography exhibition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s206","en":"The expanded service led to a twofold increase in passenger numbers.","zh":"服务扩展使乘客人数增加到原来的两倍。","note":"twofold · 两倍地， 双重地；两倍的，双重的；两部分的 · a twofold increase","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s207","en":"She completed her bachelor’s degree while working at the library.","zh":"她在图书馆工作的同时完成了学士学位。","note":"bachelor · 学士； 单身汉 · a bachelor's degree","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s208","en":"The space probe sent back detailed images of the planet.","zh":"太空探测器传回了那颗行星的详细图像。","note":"probe · 探索，查究；探查，探测；探针； 探测器， 探测飞船； 探索， 调查 · a space probe","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s209","en":"We used a small pump to inflate the party balloons.","zh":"我们用一个小气泵给聚会用的气球充气。","note":"inflate · 使充气， 使膨胀； 使得意， 使骄傲； 抬高， 使膨胀 · inflate a balloon","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s210","en":"The storage room maintains a stable temperature throughout the year.","zh":"这间储藏室全年保持稳定的温度。","note":"stable · 稳定的，稳固的，安定的；沉稳的，持重的；马厩 · a stable temperature","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s211","en":"The school hopes to harness solar energy to power its classrooms.","zh":"学校希望利用太阳能为教室供电。","note":"harness · 控制，利用；上马具；马具 · harness solar energy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s212","en":"Please respond to the survey before the end of Friday.","zh":"请在周五结束前回答这份调查问卷。","note":"respond · 回答， 答复； 响应； 作出反应 · respond to a question","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s213","en":"She made a quick sketch of the harbour before sunset.","zh":"日落前，她快速画了一张港口速写。","note":"sketch · 画素描；概述；素描； 速写 · a pencil sketch","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s214","en":"The match continued after a minor incident near the entrance.","zh":"入口附近发生了一起小事件后，比赛继续进行。","note":"incident · 发生的事； 事件， 事变 · a minor incident","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s215","en":"The lift is closed this morning for routine maintenance.","zh":"电梯今天上午关闭，进行例行维护。","note":"maintenance · 维持； 保养； 抚养费 · routine maintenance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s216","en":"A small cluster of houses stood beside the winding river.","zh":"弯曲的河流旁坐落着一小片房屋。","note":"cluster · 成群； 群集；串，束，群 · a cluster of houses","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s217","en":"The guide pointed out several birds of prey above the valley.","zh":"导游指给我们看山谷上空的几只猛禽。","note":"prey · 捕食； 折磨， 使烦恼； 掠夺；猎物，捕获物；牺牲品，战利品 · birds of prey","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s218","en":"The child began to tug at her father's sleeve.","zh":"那个孩子开始拉父亲的袖子。","note":"tug · 用力拖 · tug at a sleeve","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s219","en":"The expedition collected rock samples from several remote mountain sites.","zh":"考察队从几处偏远山地采集了岩石样本。","note":"expedition · 远征， 探险， 考察； 旅行， 出行； 远征队， 探险队， 考察队 · a scientific expedition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s220","en":"The museum display compares the skeletons of several vertebrate species.","zh":"博物馆的陈列比较了几种脊椎动物的骨骼。","note":"vertebrate · 有脊椎的；脊椎动物 · a vertebrate species","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s221","en":"We bought tickets to a concert in the old theatre.","zh":"我们买了老剧院一场音乐会的门票。","note":"concert · 音乐会， 演奏会 · attend a concert","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s222","en":"She seemed unconcerned about the delay and continued reading.","zh":"她似乎不在意延误，继续看书。","note":"unconcerned · 漠不关心的； 不烦恼的 · unconcerned about","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s223","en":"The sponge can absorb most of the spilled water.","zh":"海绵能吸收大部分洒出来的水。","note":"absorb · 吸收； 吸引…的注意， 使全神贯注； 把…并入， 同化 · absorb water","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s224","en":"The village needs a reliable supply of clean drinking water.","zh":"村庄需要稳定的清洁饮用水供应。","note":"supply · 供给，供应；；供给， 供应； 满足， 弥补 · a reliable supply","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s225","en":"The decline in library visits has caused concern among staff.","zh":"图书馆到访人数下降引起了员工的担忧。","note":"concern · 涉及；使关心； · cause concern","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s226","en":"The researchers examined the subsoil beneath the vegetable garden.","zh":"研究人员检查了菜园表土下方的底土。","note":"subsoil · 底土， 下层土 · the subsoil layer","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s227","en":"The receptionist gave us a fact sheet about local transport.","zh":"接待员给了我们一份当地交通资料摘要。","note":"fact sheet · 情况简报，资料摘要 · a fact sheet","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-20:s228","en":"Visitors should refrain from touching the paintings in the gallery.","zh":"参观者应避免触摸画廊中的画作。","note":"refrain · 抑制，克制；反复句， 叠句； 副歌； 经常重复的评价 ·